    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> is a psychological horror game set in an abandoned, haunted hospital. The player controls a young man who, after his death, becomes trapped in an alternate hospital. To return to the world of the living, he must solve mysterious tasks and endure mentally exhausting trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a slow-paced, atmospheric horror experience that focuses on psychological tension, oppressive ambiance, and environmental storytelling. There are no dialogues or human voices\u2014the story unfolds solely through the eerie environment, unsettling events, and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> \u2013 Pulls you into a dark and oppressive world, creating a constant sense of uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.poster.avif?t=1754640009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.webm?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.mp4?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Walking simulator with minimalist puzzles</strong> \u2013 No complex riddles; the game focuses on exploration and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalist yet haunting visuals</strong> \u2013 Enhances the feeling of isolation and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.poster.avif?t=1754640009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.webm?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.mp4?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> \u2013 Hidden messages, ominous details, and disturbing events lead you toward the final resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Single-player, first-person horror</strong> \u2013 Combines liminal space aesthetics with psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy psychological horror and liminal space games like <i>Layers of Fear, SOMA, The Stanley Parable, The Exit 8, Paratopic, Anemoiapolis,</i> or <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, then <strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> will be a perfect choice for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> is a psychological horror game set in an abandoned, haunted hospital. The player controls a young man who, after his death, becomes trapped in an alternate hospital. To return to the world of the living, he must solve mysterious tasks and endure mentally exhausting trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a slow-paced, atmospheric horror experience that focuses on psychological tension, oppressive ambiance, and environmental storytelling. There are no dialogues or human voices\u2014the story unfolds solely through the eerie environment, unsettling events, and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric psychological horror</strong> \u2013 Pulls you into a dark and oppressive world, creating a constant sense of uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.poster.avif?t=1754640009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.webm?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/7f440fd7ed9738f5ffd6f5981db4a1ae.mp4?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Walking simulator with minimalist puzzles</strong> \u2013 No complex riddles; the game focuses on exploration and visual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Minimalist yet haunting visuals</strong> \u2013 Enhances the feeling of isolation and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.poster.avif?t=1754640009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.webm?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518110/extras/f369e84895371e3d556153cc66fa0e4a.mp4?t=1754640009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> \u2013 Hidden messages, ominous details, and disturbing events lead you toward the final resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Single-player, first-person horror</strong> \u2013 Combines liminal space aesthetics with psychological horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy psychological horror and liminal space games like <i>Layers of Fear, SOMA, The Stanley Parable, The Exit 8, Paratopic, Anemoiapolis,</i> or <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, then <strong>Exit the Abyss</strong> will be a perfect choice for you!</p>",
    "short_description": "Exit the Abyss is a psychological horror game where you are trapped in an abandoned, haunted hospital. The game focuses on an oppressive atmosphere, exploration, and mysteries, with minimalist puzzle elements. Immerse yourself in a distorted reality, confront your fears, and find the way out!",
